  - english: The residents call those creatures Error Dust. Please help anyone you
      meet.
    vietnamese: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xE2n g\u1ECDi l\u0169 sinh v\u1EADt \u1EA5y l\xE0
      B\u1EE5i L\u1ED7i. Tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i, nh\u1EDB gi\xFAp m\u1ECDi
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\xE9."
